e prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Rockcastle County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, April to May hit 200% of normal on the middle, while July to August fell to 72%. Grid 21184 had its driest year in 1999 at 67% of normal. The preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 20883 sits at 83.0, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
